# ============================================================================
# fractal-ai-research — .gitignore
# ============================================================================
# Excludes:
#   - external clones of FragileTech repos (their own license, not ours)
#   - Python virtualenvs (machine-specific)
#   - generated benchmark results (regeneratable)
#   - editor/OS artifacts
# ============================================================================

# External repos: kept inside repos/ but their own .git histories removed
# (they're cloned from FragileTech for analysis; their LICENSE files are preserved)

# Python virtualenvs (recreatable from requirements; large + machine-specific)
**/.venv/
**/venv/
**/.env
**/*.egg-info/
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc

# Atari ROMs (legal but large — install via `AutoROM --accept-license`)
**/AutoROM/roms/

# Benchmark results (regeneratable)
work/03_atari_replication/results/*.json
work/03_atari_replication/results/*.txt
# Keep the report
!work/03_atari_replication/results/SMOKE_TEST_REPORT.md

# Editor / OS artifacts
.DS_Store
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
*~

# Node (if any plugin work happens)
**/node_modules/

# Claude Code session artifacts
.claude/scheduled_tasks*
.claude/backups/

# nWave artifacts
.nwave/

# Personal notes (move to docs/personal/ if needed)
NOTES_PERSONAL.md
TODO_PRIVATE.md
